      {
        "id": 8728,
        "title": "Operator ketidaksamaan",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Inequality operator",
            "id": 76877,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memeriksa apakah suatu angka tidak sama dengan angka lainnya, kita menggunakan <strong>operator ketidaksamaan</strong>, <code>!=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memeriksa apakah suatu angka tidak sama dengan angka lainnya, kita menggunakan <strong>operator ketidaksamaan</strong>, <code>!=</code>.</p><p>Tambahkan operator agar perbandingan <code>1</code> dan <code>10</code> mencetak <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Inequality operator",
            "id": 76873,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menyimpan hasil perbandingan dengan operator ketidaksamaan dalam variabel seperti di sini, tempat kita akan menyimpan perbandingan <code>1 != 2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menyimpan hasil perbandingan dalam variabel.</p><p>Simpan apakah <code>1</code> tidak sama dengan <code>2</code> dalam <code>result</code> agar kode mencetak <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Result ==",
            "id": 76875,
            "contentType": "interactive",
