            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel juga dapat menyimpan hasil perbandingan kesamaan, seperti <code>result = 1 == 2</code>. </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>result</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
